"Around this time, Amoh lets a blight into Quilbor, and Badud annihilates it."
"Years later, in Esebus, Amoh poisons Khachi and Nathan and douses Aarl with acid."
"Aarl bisects him there; his body goes to Sarya, and he respawns."
"Later, in the Ostren war, Khachi kills him with the words \"By my word, you die.\""
"At the Conclave, Lyra Alys of his Seminary dies to Aarl in a duel."
